## 29d9bc0725c4

**A29D-1 — Reproduced exact-control defect: the advertised `color` axis is ignored, including invalid values.** Against generator SHA-256 `37008fe747bffe5c68d5bbc0484194f85db8cd2b01be3fc5d45501fab27c0d47`, seed `20261020`, sample index `4`, all of these calls returned the identical 7×6 grid with a single color-7 seed at `(1,1)`:

- `color=1`;
- `color=9`;
- invalid declared-out-of-range `color=99`;
- no color override.

The same probe also found helpful `texture="warm"` versus `"cool"`, `anchor_corner=False` versus `True`, and an undeclared `misspelled_axis` all byte-identical. A 6×6 dimension control changed the dimensions as requested. Full evidence and replay command are in `checks/audit/29d9bc0725c4/override_and_validator_probe.json`.

**A29D-2 — Reproduced validator bypass: caller metadata waives structure rather than validating the selected degenerate.** `self_check([[1,2],[3,4]])` correctly reports four nonzero seeds. The identical arbitrary grid is accepted with no messages when `meta.texture` is any of `full_grid`, `two_seeds`, or `no_seed`, even though it matches none of those named structures. This means untrusted or mismatched metadata can convert an invalid instance into a validator pass. The exact grid and all four validator results are in the same probe file.

The isolated audit lint additionally fails because `RULE_HASH` is missing and warns about unprobed/collapsed axes; see `checks/audit/29d9bc0725c4-lint/checks/29d9bc0725c4_audit_lint.log`. The optional audit task-test stage reports no task-local or selected frozen tests; see `checks/audit/29d9bc0725c4-task-tests.console.log`.

**Impact.** Training generation can silently ignore requested semantic color and diversity controls, while validator receipts can be forged accidentally by stale metadata. Suggested repair: use `ctx.draw_color("color", exclude={0})`, validate/reject all overrides, make each advertised axis observable or diagnostic, and validate each degenerate’s actual structure instead of returning early solely from metadata. Audited source was not edited.
